WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.651
Repeated internal whitespace requires a
pattern-based solution The

00:00:05.678 --> 00:00:11.296
PostgreSQL regular-expression pattern bracket colon
space colon bracket represents whitespace

00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:18.956
The plus means one or more occurrences Replacing
that run with one ordinary

00:00:18.982 --> 00:00:25.531
space turns values with inconsistent spacing into a
more stable representation We

00:00:25.557 --> 00:00:29.505
usually trim boundaries first and then normalize the
internal whitespace
